			{id=7296,title="Glare of the Tribunal",body="Kaddrak glares at a random player, inflicting Arcane damage."},
			{id=7297,title="Dark Matter",body="Marnak summons a cloud of Dark Matter to surround a player, increasing damage taken by $51012s1%, decreasing movement speed by $51012s2% and inflicting Shadow damage to players within $51012A1 yards.$[!2\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty, damage taken is increased by $59868s1% and movement speed is reduced by $59868s2%.$]"},
