			{id=34246,title="Overview",body="Forgemaster Garfrost |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1261299|h[Throws Saronite]|h|r at players, then follows up with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1261546|h[Orebreaker]|h|r. Occasionally, he lets loose a mighty |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1261847|h[Cryostomp]|h|r, increasing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1261806|h[Siphoning Chill's]|h|r danger.\n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, Garfrost activates a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262029|h[Glacial Overload]|h|r from his closest forge."},
			{id=34247,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Garfrost |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1261299|h[Throws Saronite]|h|r at targeted players.\n$bullet;Saronite ore offers protection from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262029|h[Glacial Overload]|h|r."},
