		sections={
			{id=34357,title="Overview",body="Krick and his construct, Ick, battle players simultaneously. |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264259|h[Shades of Krick]|h|r channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264186|h[Shadowbind]|h|r while Ick attacks with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264336|h[Plague Expulsion]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264287|h[Blight Smash]|h|r.\n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, Krick yells, \"|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264363|h[Get 'Em, Ick!]|h|r,\" commanding his monstrous minion to attack specific players."},
			{id=34358,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264259|h[Shades of Krick]|h|r explode for significant damage if not defeated quickly.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264186|h[Shadowbind]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1278893|h[Death Bolt]|h|r inflict significant harm unless stopped.\n$bullet;Krick's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264363|h[Get 'Em, Ick!]|h|r compels Ick to fixate a player, ignoring others at all costs."},
			{id=34359,title="Healer",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264027|h[Shade Shift]|h|r inflicts significant damage to all players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264259|h[Shades of Krick]|h|r channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264186|h[Shadowbind]|h|r, inflicting intense periodic damage.\n$bullet;Krick's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264363|h[Get 'Em, Ick!]|h|r compels Ick to fixate a player, ignoring others at all costs."},
			{id=34360,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Ick's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264287|h[Blight Smash]|h|r inflicts significant damage to his primary target.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264186|h[Shadowbind]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1278893|h[Death Bolt]|h|r inflict significant harm unless stopped.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264259|h[Shades of Krick]|h|r explode for significant damage if not defeated quickly."},
