			{id=17347,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Stop casting spells to avoid being interrupted while the Feral Defender is casting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:64496|h[Feral Rush]|h|r.\n$bullet;Interrupt Auriaya's casts of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:64389|h[Sentinel Blast]|h|r.\n$bullet;Assist in splitting the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:64422|h[Sonic Screech]|h|r."},
